  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 2,
  "is_atomic": false,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When a marshaling station is used (i.e., some flow passes through it), is the fixed cost f_k incurred once per station regardless of how much is transshipped?",
    "Is the station allowed to be used only if that fixed cost is paid (i.e., flow through station k is zero unless it is opened)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains two semantically independent questions: one regarding the nature of the fixed cost (one-time vs. variable) and another regarding the logical constraint linking flow to the payment of that cost."
}

